/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 155 0 R
/T (Many people struggle to find suitable recipes, organize meals for the week, and maintain a structured record of their favorite dishes. Existing recipe platforms mainly focus on recipe discovery but may not provide an integrated meal-planning facility.The proposed Recipe Sharing Platform with Meal Planner provides a centralized system where users can create, share, search, save, and review recipes while also planning meals for specific days. The system helps users organize their daily and weekly meals efficiently and reduces the effort required to decide what to cook.)
/E (Many people struggle to find suitable recipes, organize meals for the week, and maintain a structured record of their favorite dishes. Existing recipe platforms mainly focus on recipe discovery but may not provide an integrated meal-planning facility.The proposed Recipe Sharing Platform with Meal Planner provides a centralized system where users can create, share, search, save, and review recipes while also planning meals for specific days. The system helps users organize their daily and weekly meals efficiently and reduces the effort required to decide what to cook.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
