<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 157 0 R
/E (The proposed system is a web-based application consisting of a frontend, backend, and database.Users can register and log in to the platform. After authentication, they can browse recipes, search for specific dishes, view recipe details, and interact with recipes. Users can also upload their own recipes with ingredients, cooking instructions, preparation time, and images.The meal planner allows users to select a recipe and assign it to a particular date and meal type such as breakfast, lunch, dinner, or snack. Users can therefore organize their meals for an entire week.An administrator can manage users, recipes, categories, and reported content)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
